Cell["\<\
A directed edge is never the same as an unordered one, so a and au are not \
isomorphic:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"071855a5-c027-b543-aed6-1bf83c92e21a"],

Cell["IsomorphicHypergraphQ[a, au]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"ca3c417f-1a67-814f-a062-0faa28a0e1ef"],

Cell[BoxData["False"], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"3cc2164f-a67c-3c47-b413-6509c3d37ed9"],

Cell["Labels count only up to renaming", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"84ccb4f2-c968-934c-9cbc-80a160c8793a"],

Cell["\<\
The two hypergraphs below are the same directed path, one carrying edge \
labels a and b, the other x and y. They are isomorphic: on top of the vertex \
renaming sits the label correspondence a \[Rule] x, b \[Rule] y.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5a3a9689-4ba5-0546-a133-35c57643780b"],

Cell["\<\
h1 = Hypergraph[{Edge[{1, 2}, \"Directed\", \"a\"], Edge[{2, 3}, \
\"Directed\", \"b\"]}];
h2 = Hypergraph[{Edge[{4, 5}, \"Directed\", \"x\"], Edge[{5, 6}, \
\"Directed\", \"y\"]}];
{h1, h2}\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"7f568aed-54aa-ec41-93e3-336319ca22f3"],

