\"Directed\", \"q\"]}];
t2 = Hypergraph[{Edge[{1, 2}, \"Directed\", \"q\"], Edge[{2, 3}, \
\"Directed\", \"p\"]}];
{t1, t2}\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"01184d6e-5886-7c4a-99a0-25cdd9f0e10c"],

