Cell["\<\
The labels can force the renaming to be a non-trivial one. These two stars \
differ only in which arm carries f and which carries g, so they are \
isomorphic, but only by a map that exchanges vertices 2 and 3:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1f1a4f7e-d519-304d-8c9a-ca0b505a352f"],

Cell["\<\
s1 = Hypergraph[{Edge[{1, 2}, \"Directed\", \"f\"], Edge[{1, 3}, \
\"Directed\", \"g\"]}];
s2 = Hypergraph[{Edge[{1, 2}, \"Directed\", \"g\"], Edge[{1, 3}, \
\"Directed\", \"f\"]}];
{s1, s2}\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"839876c2-9665-0e48-9529-c411e2ce155f"],

