Cell["\<\
Isomorphism is decided by putting each hypergraph into a canonical form, in \
which the vertices are renamed to 1, 2, \[Ellipsis] . Isomorphic hypergraphs \
have identical canonical forms:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8ab03595-63e4-e843-b5ed-8cdddaadf3c2"],

